  "headline": "Mannitol is not on FDA's current shortage list; an earlier shortage posted 2021-09-23 is resolved; Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC plant last inspected VAI 2023-10-13 is the top alternate",
  "headline_cites": ["D5", "D6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show mannitol is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; a prior shortage was first posted on 2021-09-23 and is now resolved.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its plant was last inspected with a VAI classification on 2023-10-13.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 39 bags of the 10 g/100 mL 500 mL presentation at 4.8 per day for 8.2 days on hand, and Corvale General has 53 bags at 4.3 per day for 12.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "For the 20 g/100 mL 250 mL presentation, Corvale East holds 60 eachs at 3.8 per day for 15.7 days on hand, and Corvale General holds 54 eachs at 4.2 per day for 12.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A P&T-approved interchange allows the same molecule at an alternate concentration or vial size, linking NDC 00338035303 to NDC 00264757820 (20 g/100 mL) with pharmacist verification required.",
      "cites": ["E29"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter Healthcare Corporation plants (FEI 1025114 and 1416980) have recent OAI inspections on 2024-02-09, 2024-08-01, and 2026-04-02, with a Warning Letter issued 2026-09-29 for FEI 1416980.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E23", "E25", "E26"]
    }
  ]
}
